            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// Create an instant whose negative nano adjustment is normalized into the seconds field. TaiInstant instantWithNegativeNanoAdjustment = TaiInstant.ofTaiSeconds((-3113L), (-1194L));"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 34,
            "end_line": 35,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// Zero out the nanosecond component; seconds remain unchanged after prior normalization. TaiInstant instantWithZeroedNanos = instantWithNegativeNanoAdjustment.withNano(0);"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 37,
            "end_line": 38,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// The original instant has a large positive nano offset, so it is after the zeroed copy. boolean originalIsAfterZeroed = instantWithNegativeNanoAdjustment.isAfter(instantWithZeroedNanos);"
